{"id": "3309353", "revid": "309008", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3309353", "title": "Uli Stein", "text": "Ulrich \u201eUli\u201d Stein () este un fost juc\u0103tor de fotbal german.\nCarier\u0103.\nPortarul a evoluat la Arminia Bielefeld (1976\u20131980), Hamburger SV (1980\u20131987), Eintracht Frankfurt (1987\u20131994), Hamburger SV (1994\u20131995) \u0219i Arminia Bielefeld (1995\u20131997). A c\u00e2\u0219tigat de dou\u0103 ori campionatul german (1982, 1983), de dou\u0103 ori Cupa Germaniei (1987, 1988) \u0219i Cupa Campionilor Europeni din 1983.\nCu echipa na\u021bional\u0103 a Germaniei de Vest a devenit vicecampion mondial din 1986 \u00een calitate de portar de rezerv\u0103.\nPalmares.\nHamburger SV\nEintracht Frankfurt"}
